# Star Struck (windurst 10): 197's option below 0. The epistle given by GM: 197 finished with option -1 (the client's
# 0xFFFFFFFF: not 0, nothing, still available), then option 0 (begun). The main flow takes options 1 and 2.
lists WindurstWalls/Koru-Moru/onTrigger WindurstWalls/onEventFinish/197
char zone=WindurstWalls pos=-120.2,-5.5,122.4
item TornEpistle
login
trigger Koru-Moru                              # the epistle held: 197
finish option=-1                               # not 0: nothing (still available)
trigger Koru-Moru                              # 197 again
finish option=0                                # begun
trigger Koru-Moru                              # accepted: 198
finish
